# Fixed daily universe

`HK_TICKERS` and `US_TICKERS` in `tradingagents/daily/sp500.py` are a fixed list. Do not re-rank them by turnover, volume, or a new session, and do not add or remove a name.

Change that list only when the user explicitly asks for a different set of symbols.
